WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.700
Here are 10 unique date ideas in L. A.

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:03.220
That are not just going to a restaurant.

00:00:03.221 --> 00:00:06.140
Number one is the Melrose Trading Post which happens every Sunday.

00:00:06.141 --> 00:00:08.220
It's so cute to walk around, shop,

00:00:08.221 --> 00:00:10.060
listen to some music, and grab a bite to eat.

00:00:10.061 --> 00:00:11.940
Number two is biking on the west side of L. A.

00:00:11.941 --> 00:00:13.780
You can bike all through Venice and Santa Monica

00:00:13.781 --> 00:00:15.380
and there's tons of stops along the way.

00:00:15.381 --> 00:00:17.700
No. 3 is going to a concert at the Venice West.

00:00:17.701 --> 00:00:21.100
It's a fun, low key music venue in Venice with some great live performers.

00:00:21.101 --> 00:00:22.940
No. 4 is going on a graveline tour,

00:00:22.941 --> 00:00:24.420
especially if you love true crime.

00:00:24.421 --> 00:00:25.780
This is such a unique thing to do.

00:00:25.781 --> 00:00:29.020
You can book all all different kinds of tours about true crime stories in L. A.

00:00:29.021 --> 00:00:29.980
And you drive around L. A.

00:00:29.981 --> 00:00:30.620
In a limo.

00:00:30.621 --> 00:00:34.300
No. 5 is a mosaic lamp making class or an art class with art masterclass.

00:00:34.301 --> 00:00:36.500
They offer these at different locations across L. A.

00:00:36.501 --> 00:00:38.180
It's so much fun to get creative here!

00:00:38.181 --> 00:00:39.500
No. 6 is a moonlight hike!

00:00:39.501 --> 00:00:41.380
This is such a wholesome and cute thing to do.

00:00:41.381 --> 00:00:44.820
The night starts with live music as the sun goes down and you can go on a hike,

00:00:44.821 --> 00:00:45.860
but you can choose from easy,

00:00:45.861 --> 00:00:46.760
medium, or hard.

00:00:46.761 --> 00:00:48.460
No.7 is a candlelight concert.

00:00:48.461 --> 00:00:50.020
They have different concerts across L.

00:00:50.021 --> 00:00:52.540
A. At various venues with different genres of music.

00:00:52.541 --> 00:00:54.540
No. 8 is walking through the Venice Canals,

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:57.940
and there's also tons of bars and restaurants and the beach right by there,

00:00:57.941 --> 00:00:59.140
so you can grab a drink after.

00:00:59.141 --> 00:01:01.460
No. 9 is bringing a dining experience to you.

00:01:01.461 --> 00:01:02.660
This is such a unique thing to do.

00:01:02.661 --> 00:01:04.820
If you want something other than going out to a restaurant,

00:01:04.821 --> 00:01:06.620
you can book with a company called Chef De Serene,

00:01:06.621 --> 00:01:08.700
which offers private dining for couples or groups.

00:01:08.701 --> 00:01:10.740
And No. 10 is driving down P C H.

00:01:10.741 --> 00:01:12.620
And specifically going to El Matador Beach.

00:01:12.621 --> 00:01:14.020
You can post up for the whole day,

00:01:14.021 --> 00:01:15.300
explore all the cool rocks,

00:01:15.301 --> 00:01:16.500
or just go and watch the sunset.

00:01:16.501 --> 00:01:17.902
Follow me for more unique things to do.
